@FEAT-003
Feature: Cart management # validation/features/cart_management.feature:2
  As a customer
  I want to add, remove, and adjust items in my cart
  So that I can manage my order before checkout
  @TC-009 @US-005 @positive @high
  Scenario: Add a dish to the cart                         # validation/features/cart_management.feature:8
    Given the meal "Salmon Roll" is available              # validation/features/steps/application_steps.py:17
    When the customer taps "Add to cart" on "Salmon Roll"  # validation/features/steps/application_steps.py:17
    Then "Salmon Roll" appears in the cart with quantity 1 # validation/features/steps/application_steps.py:58
    And the cart total is updated "10.00" to include it    # validation/features/steps/application_steps.py:63

